## Seeding

{{#if (hasRootScript "db:seed")}}
{{#unless blueprint}}
{{> seed/deletes-users}}
{{else}}
`{{runScript "db:seed"}}` runs `scripts/seed.ts`, which deletes users: always, or only with `--reset` when the script has that flag. Read it before you run it on a database whose accounts you want to keep.
{{/unless}}
{{#if (hasRootScript "local-setup")}}
`{{runScript "local-setup"}}` runs the seed, so the same applies to it.
{{/if}}
{{else}}
`{{runScript "local-setup"}}` seeds the local database, which can delete its data.
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
